Server init.
>> a := Blob ncha: 4.
a bytes: ( Lethathamo ncha ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ncha: 4.
b bytes: ( Lethathamo ncha ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a ncha.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Sephetho ngola: ( a ^ c ), mola-o-mocha. } tšoasa: { :e Sephetho ngola: e, mola-o-mocha. }, qala.
a lokolla.
b lokolla.
